            },
            "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 5107, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Clyde demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
